# meta::summary2 = This guide explains how to get rid of mice without chemical products, and recommends keeping food stored away, placing peppermint oil-infused cotton balls in the house, or dried snake feces, getting a good-mouser cat, using devices to emit ultrasounds or organic deterrents, moving the trash cans away from the home, and attracting birds of prey in the garden with a nesting box.
